e-adc6-4627-be1a-65628cc04fd1" facs="#m-f9aea143-47c5-400a-afd7-9e5808c380a0" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-0b92c7ae-9cd5-4b7b-8361-318190514133" facs="#m-6d1a777b-a8b8-4d0a-98da-ce34bcdcc20c" label="lyrics-like">vOnferat nobis Dómine sancti ! súmpsimus, significáta venerémur,</l><l xml:id="m-89015a80-21dd-4346-822c-b5fa55f918c3" facs="#m-248eb4da-5591-4162-bd50-86a51c922fc8" label="lyrics-like">L Joánnis Baptistae solémnitas: et in nobis potius édita gaudeámus.</l><l xml:id="m-607142e8-7ade-4349-9895-f4fc6518c679" facs="#m-d63cb295-2bca-445a-8437-3debf1b54a9a" label="lyrics-like">ut et magnífica sacraménta quae! Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-37c5064f-247c-4150-ae25-cf6a57e52a18" facs="#m-693cba62-f204-4907-9fc4-06d54c2ac54e" label="lyrics-like">Of St. Sabina. Postcommunion. Divini múneris... beáta Sabina Martyre</l><l xml:id="m-f89c6ecb-1e8e-4ae9-90b9-dfa63a31c8c4" facs="#m-99f4b928-d23d-4039-a47b-9a9de4a8b44f" label="ambiguous">tua. 1224.</l><l xml:id="m-63c2aac7-1c5b-4ae8-a98f-5e7679083352" facs="#m-5a9bc9ac-23d4-47c5-86cc-b806cd070ec6" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-3baf6af9-c5d2-4b05-b9e6-80d4d2e79391" facs="#m-f3c26620-a9af-4ca1-b00d-d736de0beb2f" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 3. a. p. 129. — 2. Confitébor. 3. b. p. 185.</l><l xml:id="m-65a3370c-e727-4695-af5d-3a6a92bf3e0e" facs="#m-86ce856f-f75a-44a2-8c75-8faada2bd8f1" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Beátus vir. I. f. p. 140. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 1. D. p. 148. —</l><l xml:id="m-0d68f83b-a30d-45cb-8107-44f0287c25bf" facs="#m-716553a7-b3de-409a-9bb9-e83d199605d2" label="lyrics-like">5. Crédidi. 4 A. 164.</l><l xml:id="m-c957f360-cc24-4191-b69d-6593e5fd4260" facs="#m-7fe2f67f-e57d-4682-8fed-33ef9c9dd006" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-29384973-bcc0-4cb3-ac8c-0f1060a40bf7" facs="#m-6f13c6a0-8764-4cb0-8f22-3b7ad775a118" label="ambiguous">s.a</l><l xml:id="m-df6996e4-c86c-4016-adb9-8e86edba19fa" facs="#m-40d558e6-eff0-4ddf-af04-c2fb1eca13d0" label="lyrics-like">Eródes enim ténu-it“ et ligávit Jo-ánnem, et</l><l xml:id="m-6b6246fd-78a2-4a49-aab7-9d0e5bf17471" facs="#m-9ceeab8f-6cb0-448a-a5ef-850ef7b89a10" label="lyrics-like">pósu-it in cárcerem propter He-ro- dí-adem. E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-8d955319-45f6-4af8-8c9f-db5138506d48" facs="#m-a744d790-6379-446a-88b2-cc84fa519c42" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.H</l><l xml:id="m-a55eb0d7-bc6f-48b3-b80b-c0147012e0a0" facs="#m-e694c8b8-7ccb-4164-b5a3-1e3f735e474c" label="ambiguous">3.b</l><l xml:id="m-e69fcbf9-9541-49df-a4d3-652fc9bce8c5" facs="#m-d7adc356-f407-43af-8653-7531d656513a" label="lyrics-like">DOmine mi rex, "da mí-hi</l><l xml:id="m-fb15dfe0-04e6-4f96-bbc8-35eae3e321a2" facs="#m-c20c7481-2c38-4be0-a9f7-f41fb2f7ba58" label="lyrics-like">in dí-sco cáput</l><l xml:id="m-e2d443e9-3f01-4e79-81c5-b9db25f3338a" facs="#m-d8164102-c16c-4097-8d25-632376a61ba4" label="ambiguous">8. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ba307409-b98b-4d98-9b3f-9be4d863b078" facs="#m-411b6d0d-8c87-4a48-b39c-a259960e1091" label="ambiguous">1.1</l><l xml:id="m-95154a1b-b301-4bfe-b346-fc2a53fecd16" facs="#m-32324ddd-3697-4339-8fd8-5d3af68bbac2" label="lyrics-like">U-éllae sal¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ac566db-1a5f-42b7-b285-f87edfcfbcdc" facs="#m-48add2fd-d2e3-4e09-bb92-0e64985f07db" label="lyrics-like">Jo-ánnis Baptístae.</l><l xml:id="m-ec8d05f7-5e73-4ece-a884-332390663828" facs="#m-9c701074-5e80-46bd-b9a2-30085be4afb2" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-223f4cb9-9548-49be-bad0-4a251233267f" facs="#m-c0c023b8-170c-4b79-8f9d-1b2bf31f78e7" label="lyrics-like">tánti“ imperávit má-ter : Ni-hil á-li-ud pé-tas, ni-si</l><l xml:id="m-b1c12a36-5e40-41fd-af08-3eec84c586fb" facs="#m-f1687532-10ea-4c97-8e71-f37d9d4a4c90" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-975fb926-19a2-4a10-ac3d-10a31718e1c6" facs="#m-ae1ff1f3-bd46-4fe5-9525-fd714d2201c7" label="ambiguous">1.p</l><l xml:id="m-9546d1cf-c716-477b-b907-7c18739d3abf" facs="#m-5c0d3636-fed3-4d04-8acd-e42b4dbe195c" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-1b264353-360f-4f6e-a2dd-a05e7db5f812" facs="#m-b3561dab-fd08-4aba-9d8e-5b977e216e94" label="lyrics-like">Rgu-ébat"He¬</l><l xml:id="m-3cd21f61-e416-4eb8-bd90-f0ec5fac3f25" facs="#m-0c93e1a2-d7ff-4ba3-b9d7-5e62d8ab8ac6" label="lyrics-like">cáput Jo-ánnis. E u o u a e.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
